   "note": "one blade: a Mesh Line (20 points, offset in Z) curled by Set Position with a Vector Rotate (X axis) of each point by Index x Bending; Mesh to Curve, Set Curve Radius from the Spline Parameter through a Map Range reversed (1 at the root, 0.05 at the tip), Curve to Mesh with a Curve Line as the profile for its width. A patch: a Mesh Circle (filled with triangles), Distribute Points on Faces and Instance on Points of the blade with a Random Value vector rotation (Z only, via Combine XYZ) and random scale (0.4..1, the Z max = Height); Set Material. Density, patch size, Rotate Z, Height and Bending are Group Input sockets in the modifier",
